  eventID: PlayerStandingStillRespawn
  dialogueLines:
  - "Clearly your computer must have malfunctioned, which is why you\u2019re not
    doing anything. I\u2019ll be so kind as to reset you"
  - "I can only assume your computer has stopped working. Don\u2019t worry, I\u2019ll
